    "The Peninsula and Balboa Island run on a seasonal rental rhythm — summer weeks booked back-to-back, winter leases in between — and the appliances in those cottages work hardest exactly when a failure costs the most. A dead refrigerator on a Friday changeover isn't a nuisance — it's a refund.",
    "We work the way rental managers and HOA-managed waterfront buildings need: turnover-window scheduling, direct coordination with on-site managers, service reports back to the office, and the same coastal-aware diagnostics we run on every Newport call. Owners who are off-site stay off-site."
