    'Balboa Peninsula and Balboa Island seasonal rentals — changeover-window scheduling between stays',
    'HOA-managed waterfront — Lido Isle and Bayshores association buildings, access coordinated in advance',
    'Newport Coast and Crystal Cove community gates — logistics handled before the truck rolls',
    'Service reports and invoices straight to the management office',
    'Salt-air maintenance plans between seasons — coils, gaskets, and igniters on a coastal cadence'
