const outdoorParagraphs = [
  "Outdoor kitchen appliances — outdoor-rated refrigerators, ice makers, BBQ igniter systems — see salt-air exposure even more acutely. Salt air exposure on an outdoor unit is dramatically more aggressive than on indoor equipment. Igniter electrode corrosion, coil degradation, and control board moisture ingress are all accelerated in an oceanfront outdoor kitchen. We service and repair outdoor appliances throughout Newport Beach, including <a href=\"/brands/marvel/\">Marvel outdoor refrigeration</a> (MO24RAS units engineered for 110°F ambient + direct sun — very common on Newport Coast and Pelican Hill pool decks)."
